WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:08.560
Akatambi kano kawa ennyanjula ennyimpimpi ku kyuma kya Arclight.

2
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.520
Kikyuse ng’okozesa bbaatuuni eno enzirugavu.

3
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:18.440
Mu kusooka, enkomerero zombi eza Arclight ziyinza okujja mu kiseera kye kimu.

4
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:24.580
Singa teyaka n’akatono oba ng’amataala gazibye, bbaatule eyinza okuba ng’efuukuuse.

5
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.360
Giteekemu ng’okozesa chajingi ya USB.

6
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.240
Bw’oba ocaajinga, amataala ga kiragala gajja kwaka.

7
00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:37.510
Oluvannyuma lw’eddakiika 15, erina okuba ng’ejjula era ng’ekola okumala essaawa eziwera.

8
00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:41.390
Bw’ogireka mu musana kijja kukuuma bbaatule ng’eyaka.

9
00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.970
Tekijja kwetaaga kukyusa bbaatule oba bbaatule yonna.

10
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:49.090
Mode nga enkomerero zombi zizze ku ya kukozesebwa kwa bulijjo.

11
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:54.980
Kyusa ku eye mode ng’okwata button wansi okumala sekondi 15.

12
00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.920
Oluvannyuma situla engalo zo oddemu onyige mangu ng’ettaala eyaka.

13
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.560
Kati oli mu mbeera y’amaaso, ekyuma ekikebera amaaso we kinaajja

14
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.940
okusooka, oluvannyuma loopu y’ekitundu eky’omu maaso.

15
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:13.960
Okuddiŋŋana emitendera gino kijja kutambula okuyita mu ngeri ssatu ez’enjawulo ez’okukozesa.

16
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.740
Enkozesa eya bulijjo, amaaso, olwo amatu.

17
00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:20.080
Bw’omala okulonda mode gy’oyagala, nyweza bbaatuuni enzirugavu

18
00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.520
akyusa engeri amataala gye gaaka n’enkomerero ki eyaka.

19
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.140
Kakasa nti okozesa enkomerero entuufu okukebera okutuufu.

20
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.700
Eriiso ery’ebweru likeberebwa nga bakozesa loopu.

21
00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:41.140
Okulaba kujja kuba kutegeerekeka bulungi ng’oli kumpi nnyo n’eriiso ku sentimita nga 6.

22
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:48.300
ekitangaala ekimyufu ekidda okuva munda mu liiso ekolebwa ku buwanvu bw’omukono nga bakozesa ekyuma ekikebera amaaso obutereevu.

23
00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:53.740
Singa okulaba kuba kwa bbululu, olwo kebera ku lenzi rack eri waggulu.

24
00:01:54.160 --> 00:02:00.540
Mu mbeera eno, tewali lenzi mu kinnya ky’okulaba era reflex erina okuba nga nnungi.
